  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Megas said organizations must adopt AI for cyber defense, according to a reported statement. She described a document as \"more of a strategy, a planning document.\" In a January 2026 workshop presentation, she said AI's benefits require managing new risks and that NIST's Applied Cybersecurity Division is concerned with AI's impact on cybersecurity and privacy risk management. An October 2026 document attributed to her official role lists accelerating SI-driven autonomous agents for manufacturing productivity and critical infrastructure cyberthreat detection and remediation, while in 2024 she described the NIST AI Risk Management Framework as managing AI benefits and risks and said AI creates cybersecurity opportunities and challenges.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4",
    "s5",
    "s6"
   ],
